## Learning Through Experiments

An important part of this project is recording not only successful results but also limitations.

For each significant experiment, I aim to document:

- The problem being explored.
- The technique or model being tested.
- The input data and relevant configuration.
- The observed results.
- Any limitations, errors, or lessons learned.

This approach will help me understand why a technique works, when it may fail, and how to improve the implementation.

## Why VisionForge AI?

As an Artificial Intelligence and Data Science student, I want to connect what I learn academically with practical software development.

VisionForge AI gives me a place to explore computer vision in a structured way, improve my Python skills, and gradually work toward more advanced machine learning applications.

The long-term ambition is to develop a project that demonstrates both technical understanding and the ability to build, test, and explain working software.

